  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "SDK2 avatars that previously did not have an animator controller specified in the animator component would have no additional idle animation. This is observed by how the fingers do not move when not using any gestures. However, after the Avatar 3.0 update, all SDK2 avatars now have a forced idle animation where the hands can be seen slowly opening and closing slightly when no gestures are being used. This is only noticeable when not using index controllers, and is kind of unsettling to see the fingers constantly move in a strange and unnatural looking animation. I tried reuploading SDK2 avatars with different idle overrides and animation controllers specified, but it seems to be impossible to get rid of this idle animation.",
